<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56444" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κελᾰδ-εινός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sounding, noisy</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζέφυρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					23.208
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄρτεμις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					16.183
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρὰ τὸν γιγνόμενον ἐν τοῖς
				κυνηγίοις κέλαδον</span> Sch. ad loc.); and so <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κελαδεινή</span> alone, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				21.511
			</span></i>; of Dionysus, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.524.11
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐλῶνες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Merc.</u>
					95
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῦριγξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					5.455
				</span></i>
			: neut. pl. as Adv., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποταμοὶ κελαδεινὰ ῥέοντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					3.532
				</span></i>
			:—<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
			</span></i> has 
				Aeol.
			 form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κελαδεννός</span></b> ,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔπεα κ.</span>
			<i>highsounding</i> verses, <i><span class="en">
				<u>P.</u>
				3.113
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀμφά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Pae.</u>
					5.46
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. Χάριτες</span> the
				<i>loud-voiced</i> Charites, <i><span class="en">
				<u>P.</u>
				9.89
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ὕβρις</span>
			<i>noisy</i> insult, <i><span class="en">
				<u>I.</u>
				4(3).8
			</span></i>.</div>
